ope\">684</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πέπονθα δεινὰ καὶ π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">967</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἄδικα καὶ π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ π</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">illegality</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.197</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-μως</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">illegally</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.94</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.65</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">κατὰ νόμους</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">302e</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ωτέρως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.22</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">παρανομ-ώτατα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> in Law, <span class=\"gk\">παράνομα γράφειν, εἰπεῖν</span>, to propose an <b class=\"lex-tr\">illegal</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">unconstitutional measure</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21